        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 41956eaf-82da-46c4-ae02-0953c3df5a58).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. The ICA has received an urgent contract from Interpol regarding two agents planted undercover at the GAMA private hospital. Although Agent Smith and Agent Maverick were intended to investigate suspicions of organ harvesting at the hospital, Interpol has indicated that the pair has gone rogue-- now profiting from the very crimes they were intended to expose.\r\rThe agents are unaware that Interpol is onto them, so you should have very little trouble today, 47. Good hunting.",
